{"unit_id":"Bingtang1019__dsh-ppt-fusion#card-zh","repo":"Bingtang1019/dsh-ppt-fusion","commit":"a19f4d3832e92b4c722e305c7b9b67cae9ad8153","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ppt-flashmade 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的演示文稿制作插件，将 DSH 原生前端与 DrawingML 深度引擎接入一条工作流。它注册制作说明 skill、预览工具，并提供 dsh-ppt 命令行。用户可以从主题和大纲开始，按页面规划内容，再校验、渲染并审阅 PPTX；支持模板创建与原生演示文稿往返编辑等命令。预览工具在对话中展示幻灯片缩略图与查看器。适合需要在 DSH 中创建和迭代 PowerPoint 演示文稿的用户；运行依赖 Node.js，深度渲染还需要相应本机引擎环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:101-165","src/cli.ts:80-116"]}
{"unit_id":"Bingtang1019__dsh-ppt-fusion#card-en","repo":"Bingtang1019/dsh-ppt-fusion","commit":"a19f4d3832e92b4c722e305c7b9b67cae9ad8153","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ppt-flashmade brings presentation creation to DSH Web. It provides a workflow skill, CLI, and in-chat slide preview and review. Plan, validate, and render editable PPTX decks, create templates, and work with native PowerPoint files. Deep rendering uses local engine prerequisites.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:101-165","src/cli.ts:80-116"]}
